      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "questName": "Impersonation Trail",
      "questDescription": "George Wilkerson hires you to trace how an attacker used public social media to impersonate the CEO of dataSequence and trigger a stock drop. Using a simple in-world browser and a compact social platform, you will locate a news lead, perform a people search on a named contact, map the CEO’s public social network, and produce practical mitigation recommendations. The focus is on OSINT reasoning, triage, and privacy-first remediations rather than intrusive techniques.",
      "questCompleteText": " You followed a niche news mention to a uniquely named friend, discovered public social accounts that revealed the CEO’s close network, and identified how those public details enabled a convincing impersonation. Your final report recommends prioritized steps — tighten profile privacy, verify official accounts, routinely audit public footprints, and help close contacts secure their profiles — reducing the risk of future impersonation and helping restore market confidence.",
      "questCharacterID": "u01_george_wilkerson",
      "appScenarioID": ""
    }
  ]
